<title>INDIA: India foreign currency reserves at $19.5 bln.</title>
<headline>India foreign currency reserves at $19.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foreign currency reserves were at $19.5 billion on February 27, Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday.</p>
<p>Chidambaram was presenting the federal budget for 1997/98 (April-March) in parliament.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
